{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["<b>This.</b> The measurement, like \"and this which you shall make it\" (Genesis 6:15 [?])." "<b>And the sense of kol ha'over.</b> [Meaning] those who have passed twenty years of age — and [at] about three weeks of years, then a person's knowledge is complete, and also his body will grow no taller in stature." "And these gerahs are carob kernels."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:39:23.335748526Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}